OL,3,GNEWSAStormfest recreates rescue from
OL,4,A160 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gig boat wrapped in the colours of a
OL,7,F19th Century lifeboat formed the
OL,8,Fcentrepiece of Torbay RNLI's  StormFest
OL,9,Fto mark 160 years since the Tynmouth
OL,10,Flifeboat was pulled to Torquay in 1866
OL,11,Fto rescue sailors from that winter's
OL,12,FGreat Storm.
OL,14,FMembers of Brixham Gig Club honoured
OL,15,Fthe 1860s Brixham Angels who lit
OL,16,Fbeacons using whatever they could to
OL,17,Fhelp guide stricken vessels to harbour.
OL,19,FMore than 100 sailors died during the
OL,20,Fstorm which led to the opening of
OL,21,FTorbay's first Lifeboat station later
OL,22,Fin 1866.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
